      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>Wait, where are you getting these numbers? A p-value of 0.001? Our actual data from the last trial came back with a p-value of 0.06. \n\nI know that's not quite at the 0.05 significance level, but we need to make this case for the grant. How should we frame the current results in the 'Results and Impact' section so the reviewers see the actual value of the work?",
